);\n        }\n        auth_path_offset += SPX_N;\n    }\n\n    idx >>= 1;\n    offset >>= 1;\n    set_tree_height(addr, tree_height);\n    set_tree_index(addr, idx + offset);\n    thash(root, &buffer[0..2 * SPX_N], 2, ctx, addr);\n}\n\npub type GenLeafFn = fn(&mut [u8], &SpxCtx, u32, &[u32; 8]);\n\npub fn treehash(\n    root: &mut [u8],\n    auth_path: &mut [u8],\n    ctx: &SpxCtx,\n    leaf_idx: u32,\n    idx_offset: u32,\n    tree_height: u32,\n    gen_leaf: GenLeafFn,\n    tree_addr: &mut [u32; 8],\n) {\n    let mut stack = vec![0u8; ((tree_height + 1) * SPX_N as u32) as usize];\n    let mut heights = vec![0u32; (tree_height + 1) as usize];\n    let mut offset: usize = 0;\n\n    for idx in 0..(1u32 << tree_height) {\n        let mut leaf = vec![0u8; SPX_N];\n        gen_leaf(&mut leaf, ctx, idx + idx_offset, tree_addr);\n\n        let stack_slice = &mut stack[offset * SPX_N..(offset + 1) * SPX_N];\n        stack_slice.copy_from_slice(&leaf);\n        offset += 1;\n        heights[offset - 1] = 0;\n\n        if (leaf_idx ^ 1) == idx {\n            auth_path[0..SPX_N].copy_from_slice(&leaf);\n        }\n\n        while offset >= 2 && heights[offset - 1] == heights[offset - 2] {\n            let tree_idx = idx >> (heights[offset - 1] + 1);\n\n            set_tree_height(tree_addr, heights[offset - 1] + 1);\n            set_tree_index(tree_addr, tree_idx + (idx_offset >> (heights[offset - 1] + 1)));\n\n            let combined_start = (offset - 2) * SPX_N;\n            let combined_end = offset * SPX_N;\n            let combined = &mut stack[combined_start..combined_end];\n            thash(&mut combined[0..SPX_N], combined, 2, ctx, tree_addr);\n\n            offset -= 1;\n            heights[offset - 1] += 1;\n\n            if ((leaf_idx >> heights[offset - 1]) ^ 1) == tree_idx {\n                let auth_start = heights[offset - 1] as usize * SPX_N;\n                auth_path[auth_start..auth_start + SPX_N].copy_from_slice(&stack[(offset - 1) * SPX_N..offset * SPX